  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 220°C. Line a large baking tray or roasting tin.",
    "Slice the onions into thick wedges and lightly crush the garlic. Add them to the tray.",
    "In a bowl, mix the olive oil, lemon juice, cumin, coriander, paprika, turmeric, cinnamon, black pepper and salt. Toss the chicken thighs in the spice mixture until well coated.",
    "Nestle the chicken among the onions on the tray, spreading everything out in a single layer.",
    "Roast for 30 to 35 minutes, turning the onions once halfway through, until the chicken is cooked through and browned at the edges and the onions are soft and starting to caramelise.",
    "Scatter over the parsley and serve hot, with rice, flatbread or a simple salad if you like."
  ],
